{#intro}
# Carve Showcase

A short document exercising core Carve constructs. It is written to pass
`carve lint` cleanly, so it doubles as the skill's round-trip check.

Inline: /italic/, *bold*, /*bold italic*/, _underline_, ~strike~, =highlight=,
`code`, water is H{,2,}O and energy is E = mc{^2^}. See </#tables> below,
and a footnote here.[^note] An inline aside too.^[Inline footnotes number into
the same endnotes.]

## Lists

- unordered item
- item with a continuation
+
> A note attached to the item above.
- [ ] a task
- [x] a done task

1. first
2. second

:: term
:  Its definition, one block per entry.

